# openapi-typescript declares a peer of typescript@^5.x and this project is on 6. The tool
# is a devDependency that only ever generates api/schema.d.ts, and it does that correctly
# against 6 — the peer range is stale, not a real incompatibility.
#
# This file is not a convenience: without it `npm ci` fails outright, and an EAS cloud build
# begins with exactly that command. A build that cannot install is a build that never starts.
legacy-peer-deps=true
